<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>1</b></sup> Judge me, O LORD; for I have walked in mine integrity: I have trusted also in the LORD; <i>therefore</i> I shall not slide.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>2</b></sup> Examine me, O LORD, and prove me; try my reins and my heart.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>3</b></sup> For thy lovingkindness <i>is</i> before mine eyes: and I have walked in thy truth.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>4</b></sup> I have not sat with vain persons, neither will I go in with dissemblers.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>5</b></sup> I have hated the congregation of evil doers; and will not sit with the wicked.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>6</b></sup> I will wash mine hands in innocency: so will I compass thine altar, O LORD:<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>7</b></sup> That I may publish with the voice of thanksgiving, and tell of all thy wondrous works.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>8</b></sup> LORD, I have loved the habitation of thy house, and the place where thine honour dwelleth.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>9</b></sup> Gather not my soul with sinners, nor my life with bloody men:<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>10</b></sup> In whose hands <i>is</i> mischief, and their right hand is full of bribes.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>11</b></sup> But as for me, I will walk in mine integrity: redeem me, and be merciful unto me.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm"><i>A Psalm</i> of David.</title><sup><b>12</b></sup> My foot standeth in an even place: in the congregations will I bless the LORD. <br />
